# RevoShop - environment variable template. Copy to .env; .env is gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# The database connection is set directly in config.py (SQLALCHEMY_DATABASE_URI) and is
# not read from the environment, so edit that file to point at a different database.
# SECRET_KEY is the only environment variable this project reads.

# Flask secret key. Generate your own, for example:
#   python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_hex(32))"
SECRET_KEY=replace_with_a_random_secret
